# Doctor Lab — Project Overview & Canon

**Date:** 2025-09-19

## Stack (FE/BE)
- **FE**: Next.js 15 (App Router, RSC), TypeScript (strict), Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui + Radix, next-intl, Zustand, Zod + RHF.
- **BE**: NestJS 11, GraphQL (Apollo), Prisma (PostgreSQL), Redis (sessions), i18n.
- **Transport**: GraphQL (schema-first via decorators).

## Domain (MVP focus)
- Tenants (Solo / Org), Patients (global) + PatientProfile (per tenant), EMR-light, Schedules (calendar & statuses), Services, Invoices/Payments, Staff/Roles, Audit.
- Channels: email/SMS/Telegram (progressive rollout).

## Golden Rules for AI
- Follow **strict typing**; avoid `any`. Add or extend Zod/Class-Validator schemas when touching inputs/outputs.
- Respect **RSC vs Client** boundary. Prefer server components; isolate interactivity in `use client` components.
- Keep **feature boundaries** (FSD): `modules/<domain>/{{entities,features,pages,shared,widgets}}` + shared libs in `packages/*`.
- UI: shadcn wrappers only; **no inline styles**; Tailwind utility-first.
- I18n: all visible strings go through `next-intl` (FE) or i18n service (BE).
- Security: never leak secrets, PII masking in logs, do not return sensitive fields (e.g., password) via GraphQL.

